 %Let $X$ be a compact tropical variety and $D$ be a divisor on $X$.
 %Suppose that $\Gamma (X,\mathcal{O}(D))$ is finitely generated
 %and fix a minimal basis $\{ m_{1},\ldots , m_{l}\}$.
 %Let $\varphi\colon \Gamma (X,\mathcal{O}(D))\to \R^{l}$ be a function with
